{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02943","headline":"奉和圣制龙池篇 · 崔日用","name":"奉和圣制龙池篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙兴白水汉兴符，圣主时乘运斗枢。\n岸上䒠茸五花树，波中的皪千金珠。\n操环昔闻迎夏啓，发匣先来瑞有虞。\n风色云光随隐见，赤云神化象江湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔日用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}